				<r3d:description language="eng">The Institutional Research Data Repository (Dataverse Javeriana) is developed within the framework of the research data management process of the Pontificia Universidad Javeriana, which seeks to structure, strengthen and implement an adequate management of data throughout its life cycle, facilitating its proper collection, storage, protection and sharing according to international standards of responsible conduct in research.
The Institutional Repository of Research Data is an institutional instance available to researchers of the Pontificia Universidad Javeriana for the publication of data derived from their research projects, giving them a DOI to facilitate their retrieval and citation.</r3d:description>
